[
  {
    "id": "T01_welcome",
    "trigger": "on_new_game_start",
    "highlight": null,
    "text": "船长，欢迎来到你的新生活！在这个世界上，财富就在海浪之间。",
    "complete_when": "tap_anywhere",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T01_go_port",
    "trigger": "after(T01_welcome)",
    "highlight": "ui.portListButton",
    "text": "我们需要先赚到第一桶金。点开【选择目的地】，前往【灯塔岛】看看吧，听说那里木材非常便宜。",
    "complete_when": "ui.portList.opened",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T01_select_lighthouse",
    "trigger": "after(T01_go_port)",
    "highlight": "ui.portRow('port_1')",
    "complete_when": "navigation.destination == 'port_1'",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T02_arrival",
    "trigger": "after(T01_select_lighthouse) && navigation.arrived",
    "highlight": null,
    "text": "我们到了！这里的森林提供了源源不断的木材。看看这里的市场吧。",
    "complete_when": "tap_anywhere",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T02_buy_goods",
    "trigger": "after(T02_arrival)",
    "highlight": "ui.marketButton",
    "text": "打开【市场】，买入一些货物。推荐买入【木材】。你可以选中货物后调整滑块，并利用【平衡报价】让商人补足差额，最后点击确认交易。",
    "complete_when": "ui.marketPanel.opened",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T02_in_market",
    "trigger": "after(T02_buy_goods)",
    "highlight": "ui.marketPanel",
    "complete_when": "ui.tradeConfirmed",
    "is_mandatory": true,
    "action": "ui.marketPanel.close"
  },
  {
    "id": "T03_profit_hint",
    "trigger": "after(T02_in_market)",
    "highlight": "ui.portListButton",
    "text": "干得好。现在我们需要找个地方卖掉。看看目的地列表。【贸易港】是个不错的选择。",
    "complete_when": "ui.portList.opened",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T03_profit_hint_2",
    "trigger": "after(T03_profit_hint)",
    "highlight": "ui.portRow('port_2')",
    "complete_when": "navigation.destination == 'port_2'",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T04_sell_goods",
    "trigger": "after(T03_profit_hint_2) && navigation.arrived",
    "highlight": "ui.marketButton",
    "text": "这里的商人对木材需求量很大。进入市场，把货物卖掉来赚取利润吧！",
    "complete_when": "ui.marketPanel.opened",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T04_sell_goods_2",
    "trigger": "after(T04_sell_goods)",
    "highlight": "ui.marketPanel",
    "complete_when": "ui.tradeConfirmed",
    "is_mandatory": true,
    "action": "ui.marketPanel.close"
  },
  {
    "id": "T05_free_trading",
    "trigger": "after(T04_sell_goods_2)",
    "highlight": null,
    "text": "这就是贸易的魅力：利用地区间的物价差异获利。现在你已经掌握了基础。去广阔的大海自由航行吧！",
    "complete_when": "tap_anywhere",
    "is_mandatory": true,
    "action": "combat.unlock"
  },
  {
    "id": "T06_messenger_encounter",
    "trigger": "after(T05_free_trading) && navigation.arrived && !homeIsland.opened && (player.gold >= 3000 || navigation.visited_ports_count >= 5)",
    "highlight": null,
    "text": "一位举止优雅但面带疲惫的绅士在码头拦住了你：“您好，尊敬的船长。我是【我的岛屿】的代理执政官。冒昧打扰，是因为我们正面临一个巨大的转机。”",
    "complete_when": "tap_anywhere",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T06a_messenger_dialogue",
    "trigger": "after(T06_messenger_encounter)",
    "highlight": null,
    "text": "他叹了口气说道：“那座岛屿曾是这片海域的明珠，但现在由于缺乏管理而百废待兴，许多基础建设已经荒废多年，急需一位有远见的人来主持大局。”",
    "complete_when": "tap_anywhere",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T06b_messenger_request",
    "trigger": "after(T06a_messenger_dialogue)",
    "highlight": null,
    "text": "“您的贸易才华已传遍各港，大家一致认为只有您这样的贸易新星才能重振岛屿的荣光。请您务必接任领主之位，去治理那片属于您的领地！”",
    "complete_when": "tap_anywhere",
    "action": "port.unlock('home_island')",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T06c_open_port_list",
    "trigger": "after(T06b_messenger_request)",
    "highlight": "ui.portListButton",
    "text": "打开【选择目的地】",
    "complete_when": "ui.portList.opened",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T06c_open_home_island",
    "trigger": "after(T06c_open_port_list)",
    "highlight": "ui.portRow('home_island')",
    "text": "选择【我的岛屿】并出发，开启你的领主治理之路吧。",
    "complete_when": "navigation.destination == 'home_island'",
    "is_mandatory": true,
    "action": "homeIsland.setTax(0)"
  },
  {
    "id": "T06d_collect_tax",
    "trigger": "after(T06c_open_home_island) && navigation.arrived",
    "highlight": null,
    "text": "领主你终于回来了！",
    "complete_when": "tap_anywhere",
    "is_mandatory": true,
    "action": "homeIsland.unlockTax && homeIsland.setTax(2000)"
  },
  {
    "id": "T06e_tax_idle",
    "trigger": "after(T06d_collect_tax)",
    "highlight": null,
    "text": "之前村民们缴纳的税金已经闲置很久了，现在终于可以派上用场了。",
    "complete_when": "tap_anywhere",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T06f_collect_tax",
    "trigger": "after(T06e_tax_idle)",
    "highlight": "ui.collectTaxButton",
    "text": "点击岛屿上方的金币图标，领取用于重建岛屿的第一笔资金吧。",
    "complete_when": "homeIsland.tax_collected_today == true",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T06e_open_hall",
    "trigger": "after(T06d_collect_tax)",
    "highlight": "ui.hallButton",
    "text": "点击【大厅】进入岛屿的管理中心",
    "complete_when": "ui.hallPanel.opened",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T06f_explain_upgrade",
    "trigger": "after(T06e_open_hall)",
    "highlight": null,
    "text": "在大厅里，您可以投资金币升级岛屿的基建。随着税收、经济、资金和补货能力的提升，这座原本荒凉的岛屿将会在您的治理下焕发新生。",
    "complete_when": "tap_anywhere",
    "is_mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "id": "T06g_upgrade_logic",
    "trigger": "after(T06f_explain_upgrade)",
    "highlight": "ui.upgradeTab",
    "text": "尝试进行第一次基建升级，开启岛屿的繁荣纪元吧！",
    "complete_when": "ui.homeIslandUpgraded",
    "is_mandatory": true,
    "action": "ui.hallPanel.close"
  },
  {
    "id": "T10_tutorial_complete",
    "trigger": "after(T06g_upgrade_logic)",
    "highlight": null,
    "text": "无论是成为富甲一方的巨贾，还是建设最繁荣的领地，都由您决定。祝您航行顺利，领主大人！",
    "complete_when": "tap_anywhere",
    "is_mandatory": true
  }
]